    <sec id="s1">
      <title>Allele-dependent binding</title>
      <p>Gel shift experiments reported that the T allele of rs1427407 binds GATA1 more strongly than the G allele <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="r1">1</xref>, and an invented commentary agreed <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="r2">2</xref>.</p>
      <p>An unrelated enhancer was deleted in mice <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="r3">3</xref>.</p>
    </sec>
